[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_9900","text":"某个人的声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0010","text":"‘『『『『那都是为了你好』』』』’"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0020","text":"────朝日！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0030","text":"差不多该去下一个现场了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0040","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0050","text":"不好意思，这边有点忙乱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_9901","text":"共演者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0060","text":"哪里哪里，势头正好是好事啊\n下次也请多关照哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_9902","text":"共演者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0070","text":"朝日酱也去刷刷社交平台看看吧\n多被人讨厌，多被人喜爱吧────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0080","text":"今天已经没有工作了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0090","text":"啊，抱歉\n因为看起来朝日好像有点困扰……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0100","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0110","text":"……朝日\n虽然我觉得不用说你也明白……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0120","text":"被喜欢也好，被讨厌也好……\n不用去想那些多余的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0130","text":"朝日做朝日自己，就是最好的\n所以啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0140","text":"──\n好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0150","text":"从那之后工作也一如既往地接"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0160","text":"演唱会也好，综艺也好，访谈也好，当然还有训练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0170","text":"社交平台上也没再上过热搜了，\n朝日也没在意过────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_9903","text":"学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0180","text":"朝日酱，今天打扫值日……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0190","text":"已经做完啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0192","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0200","text":"‘今天在校门口碰头\n　然后直接去录音室’"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_04_0210","text":"────最重要的是，她看起来非常开心"}]
